/-! ### The Kerr–Newman Kinnersley frame as a null frame -/

/-- V-01's Kinnersley frame as a frame family: `knE M a Q A μ x = e_A^μ(x)`. -/
noncomputable def knE (M a Q : ℝ) : Fin 4 → Fin 4 → Pt 4 → ℂ := fun A μ x => knFrame M a Q x A μ

/-- V-01's dual coframe as a coframe family. -/
noncomputable def knTh (M a Q : ℝ) : Fin 4 → Fin 4 → Pt 4 → ℂ := fun C μ x => knDual M a Q x C μ

/-! ### Slice calculus for fields of `(r, θ)` -/

